Our services focus on Malaga and extend to Granada for rentals over 400 euros. There is no fixed booking window, only availability, so reach out once your date and venue are confirmed, and send your run of show and speaker order as soon as they are settled. See our [booking timeline](/blog/timeline-for-booking-wedding-rentals/) guide for more on that.

## Conclusion

Getting the most out of the Wedding Pack after you have booked it comes down to one thing: telling the technician what your day actually looks like. Run of show, speech order, and any curfew, sent ahead, are what let the live technician included in the [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) do the job it is included for, rather than reacting on the fly. [Contact us](/contact/) with your details once your date and venue are confirmed.

## FAQs

### When should I send my run of show to the technician?

As soon as your ceremony time, speech order and any curfew are set, ideally well before your event. Services need at least 24 hours notice at minimum, so treat that as the latest possible point, not the target.

### How does the microphone get passed between multiple reception speakers?

The live technician manages it, adjusting gain as the mic changes hands for a louder or softer speaker and catching feedback before it starts. If your reception has five or more speakers, ask about adding a second wireless microphone when you book.

### Does the same technician cover both the ceremony and the reception?

Yes. The Wedding Pack's live technician stays on site throughout the event, covering the ceremony, the speeches and the dancing, rather than a fixed setup left to run itself.

### What if my venue has a sound curfew?

Tell us the curfew when you book and the technician plans volume and timing around it. See our [outdoor wedding rental considerations](/blog/outdoor-wedding-rental-considerations/) guide for the fuller picture on curfews, wind and power.

### Can I add an extra microphone for a large wedding party?

Yes. Every package can be extended with add ons, including extra microphones and additional technician hours. Tell us your requirements when requesting a quote.
